{"data":{"id":"JOB.25","bibleId":"de4e12af7f28f599-01","number":"25","bookId":"JOB","reference":"Job 25","copyright":"PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent","verseCount":6,"content":[{"name":"para","type":"tag","attrs":{"style":"p"},"items":[{"name":"verse","type":"tag","attrs":{"number":"1","style":"v","sid":"JOB 25:1"},"items":[{"text":"1","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Then answered Bildad the Shuhite, and said, ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.1","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.1"]}},{"name":"verse","type":"tag","attrs":{"number":"2","style":"v","sid":"JOB 25:2"},"items":[{"text":"2","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Dominion and fear ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.2","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.2"]}},{"name":"char","type":"tag","attrs":{"style":"add"},"items":[{"text":"are","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.2","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.2"]}}]},{"text":" with him, he maketh peace in his high places. ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.2","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.2"]}},{"name":"verse","type":"tag","attrs":{"number":"3","style":"v","sid":"JOB 25:3"},"items":[{"text":"3","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Is there any number of his armies? and upon whom doth not his light arise? ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.3","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.3"]}},{"name":"verse","type":"tag","attrs":{"number":"4","style":"v","sid":"JOB 25:4"},"items":[{"text":"4","type":"text"}]},{"text":"How then can man be justified with God? or how can he be clean ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.4","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.4"]}},{"name":"char","type":"tag","attrs":{"style":"add"},"items":[{"text":"that is","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.4","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.4"]}}]},{"text":" born of a woman? ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.4","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.4"]}},{"name":"verse","type":"tag","attrs":{"number":"5","style":"v","sid":"JOB 25:5"},"items":[{"text":"5","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Behold even to the moon, and it shineth not; yea, the stars are not pure in his sight. ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.5","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.5"]}},{"name":"verse","type":"tag","attrs":{"number":"6","style":"v","sid":"JOB 25:6"},"items":[{"text":"6","type":"text"}]},{"text":"How much less man, ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.6","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.6"]}},{"name":"char","type":"tag","attrs":{"style":"add"},"items":[{"text":"that is","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.6","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.6"]}}]},{"text":" a worm? and the son of man, ","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.6","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.6"]}},{"name":"char","type":"tag","attrs":{"style":"add"},"items":[{"text":"which is","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.6","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.6"]}}]},{"text":" a worm?","type":"text","attrs":{"verseId":"JOB.25.6","verseOrgIds":["JOB.25.6"]}}]}],"next":{"id":"JOB.26","number":"26","bookId":"JOB"},"previous":{"id":"JOB.24","number":"24","bookId":"JOB"}},"meta":{"fumsToken":"GzQBQBwHdiz4CxaLyQeWIKK1pT75dM8_foNMgiQmzdLX9TR03jZwOe5WXIJ8QRzObrPbW51ZYxYE_7ecJJMywdV_t_3zvB3Avrzl5vFuF8u49DJdlZXUVWpNO2_lPN3tcL2RBMZ7xDmF4sWfLavBAiKAc49kBlodvu69dlWLjJx0sXYumdbcGGzv0rTnbQkhcxdFXrCJ4Yk9XTI7khWr5_H-7O95mlVZil6sWtVRVks9nU2XWqaL0ELNvnoi"}}